  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "數位行銷與品牌創新",
    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL MARKETING AND BRAND INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在探討數位行銷與品牌創新的理論與實務。學生將學習如何運用數位工具進行精準行銷，並掌握品牌創新的策略與技巧。課程內容涵蓋內容行銷、社群媒體行銷等主題，並深入探討品牌策略的運用與品牌形象的更新。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to explore the theory and practice of digital marketing and brand innovation. Students will learn how to use digital tools for precise marketing and master the strategies and skills of brand innovation. The course content covers topics such as content marketing, social media marketing, and delves into the application of brand strategies and the updating of brand images.",
